+# Version Scheme
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use Semantic Versioning (semver) as its version numbering scheme, as recorded in `config/decisions/revoke-version-scheme.json` (`"value": "semver"`); the file was later removed from the tree by the "move decision config out of the tree" commit, but that removal did not record a new decision or replace this value, so semver remains the current recorded decision.
